      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"},
      "widgets_values": ["Two hands — one older and weathered, one younger and smooth — meeting in the center of frame to pass a small ceramic tea cup with steaming amber tea between them. Warm soft daylight from the side. Symbol of trust passed between generations. Style: warm, intimate, photo-realistic close-up. Focus on hands, faces in 3/4 profile, or symbolic objects — avoid awkward full-body anatomy. Natural soft daylight, warm beige / cream / soft orange color palette matching the Zeitnest brand. Shallow depth of field. Plain off-white background (#FAFBFC) so background removal is clean. No text, no logos, no watermarks."]
